B.MA=new A.y("High Village","Kiko reaches a village at the foot of the mountain. Greet grandpa first!","A polite greeting \u2014 a good habit anywhere.",B.Q)
B.PI=new A.y("Bamboo Bridge","The village's bamboo bridge is getting shaky. The people fix it together.","Working together makes hard work feel light.",B.q)
B.Ms=new A.y("Tea Garden","Grandma picks tea leaves on the slope. Let us help gently.","Helping elders' work warms the heart.",B.q)
B.My=new A.y("Grandma's Chickens","Grandma's chickens escaped the coop. Help round them up!","Small responsibility today trains us for the big ones later.",B.K)
B.OV=new A.y("Village Well","One well is shared by many families. Take water in turns.","Queue and share the water \u2014 fair for all the neighbors.",B.K)
B.Oq=new A.y("Teacher Sari","Teacher Sari comes to school, even in heavy rain.","Teachers endure hardship for their students \u2014 respect and listen.",B.Q)
B.P9=new A.y("One-Room School","The village school has just one room. Books are shared in turns.","Sharing books and tools \u2014 so everyone can learn.",B.q)
B.Mo=new A.y("Morning Market","The village market is busy. Kiko greets the sellers kindly.","Greet and smile at the sellers \u2014 politeness is free.",B.Q)
B.Pz=new A.y("Lost Goat","A neighbor's goat got into someone's garden. Let us walk it home.","Help a neighbor without being asked \u2014 that is a kind heart.",B.q)
B.Ma=new A.y("Terraced Fields","The terraced rice fields need water. Each plot gets a fair share.","Share fairly \u2014 do not take more than your right.",B.K)
B.Nc=new A.y("River Source","The mountain river is so clear. Do not wash trash at the source.","Care for the water up high \u2014 the village below stays healthy.",B.E)
B.ML=new A.y("Community Work","The people clean the village road together this morning.","A clean place is the work of many, not just one.",B.E)
B.Mu=new A.y("Farmer Grandpa","Grandpa the farmer harvests rice. Help carry it to the barn.","Helping the old is a great kindness.",B.q)
B.Nd=new A.y("Rice Barn","Rice is stored for the hard season. Do not waste it.","Save and store for later \u2014 that is wise.",B.K)
B.PN=new A.y("Grandma Tells Tales","Grandma tells village stories at night. Listen carefully.","Listen when elders speak \u2014 there is much wisdom there.",B.Q)
B.Py=new A.y("Morning Chores","The village chief feeds the cows before sunrise.","Wake early and work hard \u2014 the habit of great people.",B.q)
B.N7=new A.y("Night Watch","The people guard the village at night, taking turns at the post.","Keeping your turn keeps everyone safe.",B.K)
B.Nk=new A.y("New Friend","A child sits alone. Kiko invites them to play together.","Invite the lonely \u2014 no one likes being left out.",B.q)
B.Nu=new A.y("Fair Chief","The village chief shares help fairly and openly with everyone.","A fair and honest leader is respected by all.",B.at)
B.PL=new A.y("The Midwife","The midwife helps a sick neighbor. She is amazing!","Those who help many people \u2014 respect and thank them.",B.Q)
B.Pj=new A.y("After the Rain","Heavy rain makes the road slippery and muddy. The people pitch in.","In hard times, helping each other speeds the recovery.",B.q)
B.OJ=new A.y("Great Harvest","The whole village harvests together. The crop is shared fairly.","Work together, enjoy together \u2014 that is lovely.",B.K)
B.Mv=new A.y("Village Hall","The village hall is cleaned for an event. Everyone helps sweep.","Public places are a shared duty \u2014 keep them clean.",B.E)
B.O3=new A.y("Harvest Feast","The village celebrates the harvest. All eat and laugh together.","Be thankful for the crop and share the joy with neighbors.",B.q)
B.N1=new A.y("Farewell Greeting","Kiko says goodbye. Kiss the grandparents' hands before leaving.","Say a polite goodbye \u2014 a sign of love and respect.",B.Q)
B.N3=new A.y("Village Friend","The last day in the mountains. The final boss awaits!","Respect for parents, teachers, and neighbors \u2014 that is who you are.",B.Q)
