B.Lo=new A.y("Busy City","The city is full of people. Kiko remembers: stay polite in the city too.","Be polite anywhere \u2014 not only at home.",B.K)
B.PX=new A.y("Red Light","The light is still red. Many are in a hurry, but Kiko waits.","Wait your turn patiently \u2014 rules keep everyone safe.",B.K)
B.Nm=new A.y("Crosswalk","Cross the street at the right spot, look left and right.","Follow road rules \u2014 it keeps you and others safe.",B.K)
B.Ni=new A.y("Bus Queue","The bus stop is crowded. Kiko queues neatly, no cutting in.","Queue in order \u2014 fair, and comfy for all.",B.K)
B.Ne=new A.y("Sorting Bins","The city has colorful bins for sorting trash.","Sort your trash \u2014 a clean city starts with one step.",B.E)
B.M9=new A.y("City Library","Kiko borrows a book. Note the return date carefully.","Return it on time \u2014 others want to read it too.",B.at)
B.Mq=new A.y("Forgotten Book","A friend left a book on the bench. Kiko knows whose it is.","Return others' things \u2014 no matter how small.",B.at)
B.Na=new A.y("Extra Change","The shopkeeper gives too much change by mistake. Kiko notices.","Extra is not your luck \u2014 return it honestly.",B.at)
B.Pv=new A.y("Dropped Money","Rp10,000 fell on the sidewalk. Kiko knows whose it is.","What is not yours, return it. Honesty makes you rich.",B.at)
B.LY=new A.y("Honest Seller","The seller weighs her goods honestly and exactly.","Support the honest \u2014 buy from those who weigh fairly.",B.at)
B.Op=new A.y("City Park","The park is green and cool. Do not step on the grass or pick flowers.","Care for public places like your own home.",B.E)
B.NG=new A.y("Lost Child","A little child cries looking for their mom. Walk them to the guard post.","Help those in trouble \u2014 do not ignore them in a crowd.",B.q)
B.OC=new A.y("The Guard","The guard watches the building all day. Greet and thank him.","Appreciate those who keep you safe.",B.Q)
B.MJ=new A.y("Save Power","The classroom light is on but the room is empty. Kiko turns it off.","Save power and water \u2014 the Earth and the bill thank you.",B.K)
B.M6=new A.y("Honest in a Test","The test is hard. Kiko could peek, but chooses to be honest.","A grade from cheating is empty \u2014 honesty makes you proud.",B.at)
B.Lv=new A.y("A Friend's Promise","Kiko promised to play at 4. Arriving on time keeps the promise.","Keep small promises \u2014 people learn to trust you.",B.at)
B.O8=new A.y("Careless Litter","Someone drops trash on the street. Kiko picks it up and bins it right.","Set a good example \u2014 do not follow the wrong.",B.E)
B.Nj=new A.y("Pedicab Driver","Pak Dimas the pedicab driver works hard. Pay the right fare.","Pay what you promised \u2014 a small but important promise.",B.at)
B.OZ=new A.y("Sharing Lunch","A friend forgot their lunch. Kiko shares his.","Share with those in need \u2014 the heart grows rich.",B.q)
