B.Pn=new A.y("Honesty Shop","A small shop with no clerk. Pay and take your change yourself.","Honest when no one watches \u2014 that is true honesty.",B.at)
B.NN=new A.y("Found Wallet","Kiko finds a wallet with money. Report it to the officer.","A valuable find is not yours \u2014 report it.",B.at)
B.M_=new A.y("Group Work","The school task is split into groups. Share the work fairly.","Everyone does their part \u2014 that is fair and light.",B.K)
B.P8=new A.y("Clean the City River","The people work together to clear trash from the city river.","A clean river means a healthy city. Pitch in too.",B.E)
B.O5=new A.y("Thank the Workers","The cleaners work at dawn. Kiko says thank you.","Appreciate others' work with sincere words.",B.Q)
B.NJ=new A.y("Honest City Kid","The last day in the city. The final boss awaits!","A good city means honest people. Start with yourself.",B.at)
