B.OY=new A.y("Starfish","A starfish is stranded on a dry rock. Return it to the water.","Help the helpless get back to their home.",B.q)
B.Or=new A.y("Clever Octopus","An octopus hides in an old bottle. Give it a natural home.","Use less plastic \u2014 so animals keep their real homes.",B.E)
B.NP=new A.y("Mangrove Roots","The mangrove forest is where little fish hide and grow.",u.N,B.q)
B.Ol=new A.y("Ghost Net","An old net is snagged on the coral, putting fish in danger.","Remove the dangerous \u2014 save many small lives.",B.E)
B.M7=new A.y("Murky Water","The sea is murky from land waste. The fish can hardly breathe.","Care for the water at home \u2014 the sea stays clean too.",B.E)
B.Od=new A.y("Blue Whale","A giant blue whale passes slowly. Give it room and admire it.","The big need not be feared \u2014 just respected.",B.q)
B.MH=new A.y("Microplastic","Plastic breaks into tiny bits, eaten by fish by accident.","Use less single-use plastic \u2014 start with your lunch.",B.E)
B.OR=new A.y("Sick Reef","The coral reef turns white from dirty water. Let us help it heal!","Clean seawater means healthy coral. Start at home.",B.E)
B.Q_=new A.y("Stingray","The stingray glides gracefully like it is floating. Just look.","Admire from afar \u2014 do not touch the wild.",B.K)
B.LQ=new A.y("Dolphins Help","Dolphins help their hurt friend rise to the surface.","Even animals help each other \u2014 how much more should we.",B.q)
B.O7=new A.y("Shipwreck","An old shipwreck becomes a new home for many fish.","From the broken, new life can be born.",B.q)
B.NL=new A.y("Wise Fisherman","The fisherman takes just enough fish and spares the small ones.","Take just enough \u2014 leave some for tomorrow.",B.K)
B.Lk=new A.y("Light in the Deep","In the deepest sea, the fish glow on their own. Magical!","There is always beauty, even in the darkest place.",B.q)
B.Ln=new A.y("Beach Trash","Trash on the beach is carried by waves to the open sea.","Clean the beach \u2014 you protect the whole sea.",B.E)
B.Pb=new A.y("Old Turtle","An old turtle has roamed the oceans. It leaves a message: protect the sea.","Heed the old \u2014 they have seen so much.",B.Q)
B.Om=new A.y("Reef Heals","The coral you cared for turns colorful and healthy again!","Small effort each day brings a big result.",B.E)
B.M3=new A.y("School of Fish","Thousands of fish swim together again. The sea is alive!","When the home is clean, the dwellers come home.",B.q)
B.L9=new A.y("Sea Researcher","The researcher studies the sea so it can be better protected.","Appreciate scientists \u2014 they work for our nature.",B.Q)
B.NW=new A.y("Cleanup Dive","Kiko and the team dive to collect trash from the sea floor.","Working together cleans the sea faster.",B.E)
B.LN=new A.y("Shining Sea","The water is clear again, the coral healthy, the fish lively. Lovely!","This is the gift of caring: a healthy nature.",B.q)
B.MZ=new A.y("Sea Hero","The last day in the deep ocean. The final boss awaits!","A healthy sea means a healthy Earth. Care for rivers, care for the sea.",B.E)
